{{!-- partials/header/burger.hbs
     Standard 4-line Bulma burger. The parent navbar sets data-target on the
     wrapping element; we hard-code the most common target but allow override
     via a CSS class on the parent (see JS in header.js which finds
     [data-target] on the burger itself — if you need a different target per
     context, inline the burger there instead of using this partial). --}}
<a role="button" class="navbar-burger"
   aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">
  <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
</a>
